  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consortium for the Integrated Stabilization and Peace in the Easter Region of the Democratic Republic of Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Consortium&apos;s overall objective is to improve the security and overall stabilization of North Kivu and Turi Provinces in the Democratic Republic of Congo. This is addressed through the inclusive dialogue structures that address drivers of conflict and supports social cohesion through policies that improve the functioning of key state institutions and reinforce state legitimacy. IOM will act as the lead of the Consortium with Cordaid, PAX and VNG-International as partners.</narrative>
  </description>
